---

<section class="container mx-auto px-6 py-24 text-center">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
    <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-7xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-6 bg-gradient-to-r from-white to-gray-400 bg-clip-text text-transparent">
      Build Software Faster with AI
    </h1>
    
    <p class="text-xl text-gray-400 mb-10 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      Kortix is your AI-powered development partner. Write, debug, and ship code 10x faster with intelligent assistance.
    </p>
    
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
      <a 
        href="/auth/signup"
        class="px-8 py-4 text-lg font-medium bg-primary-600 hover:bg-primary-700 rounded-xl transition-all hover:scale-105"
      >
        Start Building Free
      </a>
      <a 
        href="/docs"
        class="px-8 py-4 text-lg font-medium bg-gray-800 hover:bg-gray-700 rounded-xl transition-colors"
      >
        View Documentation
      </a>
    </div>
    
    <p class="mt-6 text-sm text-gray-500">
      No credit card required. Free tier includes 100 agent runs/month.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  h1 {
    animation: fadeInUp 0.6s ease-out;
  }
  
  p {
    animation: fadeInUp 0.6s ease-out 0.1s both;
  }
  
  @keyframes fadeInUp {
    from {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(20px);
    }
    to {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }
  }
</style>
